1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,413
Hi, we're team hack masters.

2
00:00:02,463 --> 00:00:08,013
Health Copilot turns a family's paper records into a verified health record,

3
00:00:08,063 --> 00:00:11,182
and then guides them between doctor visits.

4
00:00:11,232 --> 00:00:16,045
It answers from their own records, reminds them at the right time,

5
00:00:16,095 --> 00:00:21,350
spots trends and risks, and acts on its own, while they stay in control.

6
00:00:24,667 --> 00:00:29,147
Understanding a report is not the same as managing your health.

7
00:00:29,197 --> 00:00:32,095
People forget medicines, miss follow-ups,

8
00:00:32,145 --> 00:00:36,841
don't repeat tests on time, and don't know what to ask the doctor.

9
00:00:36,891 --> 00:00:42,018
In Indian families, one person often carries this for their parents too,

10
00:00:42,068 --> 00:00:44,607
across many documents and languages.

11
00:00:47,733 --> 00:00:49,410
This is Ravi's account.

12
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:52,562
He also looks after his father and mother.

13
00:00:52,612 --> 00:00:56,164
The home screen shows today's medicines for him,

14
00:00:56,214 --> 00:01:01,643
with Taken and Snooze buttons, and what the copilot found in his records.

15
00:01:04,267 --> 00:01:05,187
Scenario one:

16
00:01:05,237 --> 00:01:06,606
a new prescription.

17
00:01:06,656 --> 00:01:09,816
Ravi saw a doctor for fever three days ago.

18
00:01:09,866 --> 00:01:15,938
When he confirmed the prescription, the copilot scheduled the reminders by itself:

19
00:01:15,988 --> 00:01:21,164
the antibiotic once a day for five days, the antacid before breakfast,

20
00:01:21,214 --> 00:01:26,689
and no reminder for the fever tablet, because it's only taken when needed.

21
00:01:26,739 --> 00:01:30,496
It also drafted three questions for his next visit.

22
00:01:30,546 --> 00:01:33,707
Every action can be kept, edited or undone.

23
00:01:38,133 --> 00:01:43,544
Reminders cover the whole family's day, at each prescription's own times.

24
00:01:43,594 --> 00:01:47,658
Mark a dose as taken, or snooze it for fifteen minutes.

25
00:01:47,708 --> 00:01:52,519
A course ends by itself, so the antibiotic stops after five days.

26
00:01:52,569 --> 00:01:57,232
Follow-up visits and repeat tests come from the doctor's notes,

27
00:01:57,282 --> 00:02:02,243
and push notifications reach the phone even when the app is closed.

28
00:02:05,767 --> 00:02:06,874
Scenario two:

29
00:02:06,924 --> 00:02:08,832
Ravi's father, Ramesh.

30
00:02:08,882 --> 00:02:14,617
His HbA1c was above the range in three reports, and still rising:

31
00:02:14,667 --> 00:02:17,465
7.4, then 7.9, then 8.6 percent.

32
00:02:17,515 --> 00:02:22,894
The copilot flags the trend, shows each result with its date,

33
00:02:22,944 --> 00:02:26,187
and links to the report it came from.

34
00:02:26,237 --> 00:02:32,684
It also looks at combinations, like high sugar with high LDL cholesterol,

35
00:02:32,734 --> 00:02:35,977
or kidney results alongside diabetes.

36
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:44,899
His follow-up visit and his repeat HbA1c test are overdue,

37
00:02:44,949 --> 00:02:50,898
so the copilot prompts both, with screenings that suit his age and his diabetes.

38
00:02:50,948 --> 00:02:55,772
Every wellness tip says why it is suggested, from his own values.

39
00:02:55,822 --> 00:02:58,321
All of this is worked out in code,

40
00:02:58,371 --> 00:03:02,820
and worded for a talk with the doctor, never as a diagnosis.

41
00:03:06,767 --> 00:03:12,241
Ask Copilot answers from his own records, and shows the results it used.

42
00:03:12,291 --> 00:03:17,305
If something isn't in the records, it says so instead of guessing.

43
00:03:17,355 --> 00:03:20,528
And it never changes a medicine or a dose:

44
00:03:20,578 --> 00:03:23,367
for that, it sends him to his doctor.

45
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,595
Scenario three:

46
00:03:27,645 --> 00:03:30,833
Ravi's mother, Lakshmi, prefers Telugu.

47
00:03:30,883 --> 00:03:36,230
She taps the microphone and asks which medicines to take tonight.

48
00:03:38,730 --> 00:03:42,230
ఈ రాత్రి నేను ఏ మందులు వేసుకోవాలి?
(Which medicines should I take tonight?)

49
00:03:44,650 --> 00:03:53,320
ఈ రాత్రి మీరు ఓరోఫర్ ఎక్స్ టీ వంద మిగ్రా ఒక టాబ్లెట్ మరియు షెల్కల్ ఐదు వందల మిగ్రా ఒక టాబ్లెట్ భోజనం తర్వాత వేసుకోవాలి.
(Tonight, take one Orofer XT 100 mg tablet and one Shelcal 500 mg tablet, after food.)

50
00:03:54,333 --> 00:04:00,038
The answer came from her own reminder schedule, and was read aloud in Telugu.

51
00:04:00,088 --> 00:04:04,373
Health Copilot speaks English and twelve Indian languages,

52
00:04:04,423 --> 00:04:06,541
including right-to-left Urdu.

53
00:04:06,591 --> 00:04:09,829
Each family member keeps their own language,

54
00:04:09,879 --> 00:04:13,043
for the screens, chat, voice and reminders.

55
00:04:16,233 --> 00:04:18,769
On a phone, it works like an app:

56
00:04:18,819 --> 00:04:25,273
a bottom tab bar, the day's doses one tap away, and it installs to the home screen.

57
00:04:27,233 --> 00:04:34,118
Under the hood, insights, reminders and the copilot's decisions are plain code,

58
00:04:34,168 --> 00:04:40,438
so they work even when the AI is busy, on an always-on free-tier server.

59
00:04:40,488 --> 00:04:42,369
AI reads and explains.

60
00:04:42,419 --> 00:04:43,510
Code decides.

61
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,266
You stay in control.

62
00:04:45,316 --> 00:04:46,143
Thank you!
